; Placement and brushes --- UI 5. placement_rotate carries both R and
; Shift+R because UI 5 gives Shift+R as the reverse direction but names no
; second action ID; the reverse SIGN is therefore an unresolved contract that
; the placement consumer must read from the shift modifier, and no
; placement_rotate_reverse action has been invented here. Left click on a
; valid ghost, Shift+left click repeat, interior left click/drag and the zone
; right-drag erase are all router gestures.

