; UI ladder --- UI 5. ui_accept and ui_cancel are declared explicitly to
; REPLACE Godot's built-in defaults: the built-in ui_accept also carries Space,
; which UI 5 assigns to time_pause. Escape drives selection_clear, ui_cancel
; and open_menu in that dismissal order; UI 5 states the order, so the three
; sharing Escape is the specified ladder, not a conflict. Ctrl+Z/Cmd+Z and
; Ctrl+A/Cmd+A carry the macOS Command variants UI 5 names. Cmd+Q and Alt+F4
; are OS-reserved and are not captured.

